sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: all (standby, advertising, connected).<br>Terminates advertising or connection and returns to standby.<br>From standby, still yields CurrentState(standby).
    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.Standby()
    Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
